-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Changes made in Opaline
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  - Renamed the project, modules (opaline-*), Kotlin package
    (io.github.a1b2d56.opaline) and public symbols (OpalineTheme, ...).
  - Recalibrated colors, metrics, corner radii, typography and the dialog button
    bar against ColorOS 17 (see docs/coui17-delta.md).
  - Added the ColorOS 17 material presets (OpalineMaterial in opaline-blur).
  - Added the ColorOS 17 system icons (OpalineIcons.System in opaline-icons).
  - Restored upstream copyright notices and added this NOTICE file.

